# JOURNEY · the shop loop: buy something with the counter, own it, use it.
# Performed by tests/journeys.rs at every size in JOURNEY_SIZES, 100×30 down to 40×14.
# By hand: cargo run --example fishplay -- tests/journeys/buy-and-drink-coffee.play --size 40 14 --print

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
run /shop
expect Buy
snap the front counter
key enter
expect Coffee
key down
key enter
expect Buy Coffee
key right
expect < 2 >
snap the counter opens at the centre of the tank
key enter
absent Buy Coffee
key esc
key esc
absent Sell

run /inventory
expect Coff
expect │ 2
snap the two coffees are the whole inventory, because a new game starts with none
key esc

run /consume coffee
expect caffeinated
snap the status bar says it worked
